{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21836","headline":"通州丁溪馆夜别李景信三首 三 · 元稹","name":"通州丁溪馆夜别李景信三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雨潇潇兮鹃咽咽，倾冠倒枕灯临灭。\n倦僮呼唤譍复眠，啼鸡拍翅三声绝。\n握手相看其奈何，奈何其奈天明别。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}